<title>UK: Dexia Hypo prices 1.0 bln mark 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Dexia Hypo prices 1.0 bln mark 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Hypothekenbank, CDC Marche, DG Bank, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson, HSBC Trinkaus and Landesbank Hessen-Thurigen.</p>
<p>BORROWER * DEXIA HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    08.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.06</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    97.89     SPREAD	+21 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    * NEW NAME FOR CLF HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    8 BP	SELL CONC  17 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL NO 122 DUE FEBRUARY 2002</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
